### 1. 用户签到
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/sign?userId=1001&date=2026-05-13
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 检查签到
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/sign/check?userId=1001&date=2026-05-12
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 当月签到总数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/sign/count?userId=1001&yearMonth=202605
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 记录活跃
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/active/record?userId=1001
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. 查看日活
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/active/dau?date=2026-05-13
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. 连续3天活跃用户数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/active/consecutive?startDate=2026-05-10&days=3
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. 周活用户数（基于任意一天）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-activity/active/weekly?anyDate=2026-05-13
Content-Type: application/json